  - Max-Cut
  - hybrid quantum-classical systems
  - reproducible benchmarking
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for a resource-aware weighted Max-Cut benchmark that
  separates operational target construction, amplitude-amplification configuration,
  logical resource modeling, ideal-statevector QAOA, classical references, and
  compiler-locked validation. The package includes exact micro-instance ground truth,
  connected and structured validation tiers, BBHT unknown-solution-count analysis,
  fixed-overhead and resource-sensitivity studies, QAOA initialization and objective
  audits, Qiskit compiler evidence, generated figures/tables, tests, and fail-closed
  preflight validation. It makes no hardware-speedup or quantum-advantage claim.
